<https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7263-9946> .
<https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Defines property aspects of lis:Quality as OWL ontology\nBackground:\nThe Industrial Data Ontology (IDO) already establishes a clear distinction between properties (lis:Quality) and values (lis:QualityDatum).\nBuilding on this foundation, this ontology introduces aspects to further refine the semantics of properties (lis:Quality).\nAspects enable a more granular and standardized representation of property-related information,\nallowing for precise classification and contextualization of properties (lis:Quality) that describe the property itself,\nindependent of its specific values.\n\nThis ontology is inspired by and extends the plm ontology from POSC Caesar Association (PCA)." .
